From 02cb1d8bf8454d877ac3681d303bedd075bbd390 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 00:25:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] agent: report only the GPUs a container can open

Inside a container /sys/bus/pci is the host's bus. On a Runpod pod given one
RTX 5090 on an eight-card host, the probe listed all eight cards and the
host's BMC display, so a node summing registrations counted capacity nobody
there could use. Once nvidia-smi has answered -- it lists only the GPUs this
process can open -- an NVIDIA GPU it does not list is left out, and "No
devices were found" leaves out every one. A host where nvidia-smi is missing
or fails otherwise reports the bus as before.
